<title>USA: Kemper starts Asia fund.</title>
<headline>Kemper starts Asia fund.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kemper Funds said it unveiled the Kemper Asian Growth Fund.</p>
<p>The open-end fund will seek long-term capital appreciation by investing primarily in Asian stocks. It will follow companies in China, Indonesia, South Korea, Malaysia, Philippines, Thailand and Taiwan.</p>
<p>It said it will invest in Japan only &quot;when economic conditions warrant, and then only on a limited basis.&quot;</p>
<p>Zurich Kemper Investments Inc, the investment advisor to Kemper Funds, is a unit of Zurich Insurance Group.</p>
